---
title: How json2graph shows a document
---
flowchart LR
    %% Where a document comes from
    open[Open a file] --> detect{What type is it?}
    type[Type or paste] --> detect

    detect -->|JSON| engine[Index it in the engine]
    detect -->|YAML| convert[Convert it to JSON] --> engine
    detect -->|CSV| engine
    detect -->|CSV| table[(Show a table)]
    detect -->|Mermaid| diagram[Draw the diagram]

    engine --> drawn([Draw the graph])
    drawn --> export[/Export as an image/]
    diagram --> export
